sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant DV as DocumentValidator
    participant EV as EventSystem
    participant DM as DocumentManager
    participant AL as AuditLogs

    U->>DV: Upload Document
    DV->>DV: Validate Format & Size
    DV->>DV: Check Metadata
    
    alt Valid Document
        DV->>EV: Emit Validation Success
        EV->>DM: Store Document
        EV->>AL: Log Success
        DM-->>U: Confirm Success
    else Invalid Document
        DV->>EV: Emit Validation Error
        EV->>AL: Log Error
        DV-->>U: Show Error Details
    end